00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>昨日までのルール今日はただのルーズ</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>こわして　タントツゴール</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:03.360
I may have fooled around too much.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:32.940
You can't win. Just hand the Chaos Emeralds over.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.080
Chaos Control!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.330
My odds of winning are low if I directly confront him.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:22.320
This is a message to everyone in the galaxy.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:26.920
The Chaos Emeralds have scattered in all directions. Find and gather them.

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:29.060
This is top priority.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.250
My strategy is proceeding to Phase 2.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.790
Dispatch the assault team.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:44.260
Capture the Planet Egg from the designated world and begin the seed.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.400
Episode 53

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.400
The Messenger from the Meteor Shower

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.600
Tails, you still can't see anything?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.470
No. Maybe we'll see it when it becomes darker.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.750
A meteor shower that only occurs once ever 500 years! How romantic!

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.770
The sky will be filled with shooting stars, right?

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:24.480
According to historical records, hundreds of shooting stars will fly by in a blink of an eye.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:28.510
Let’s see who can count the most stars, Cheese!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:33.360
If Sonic was here, it would be way more romantic.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:37.110
But he's off running around somewhere.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.000
He's probably on another adventure.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:45.320
Amy, you should wish about Sonic upon a shooting star.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.890
That’s a great idea!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.500
Make a wish?

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:53.940
If you say your wish three times before the shooting star disappears, your wish will be granted.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.210
Chris told us about it.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:05:01.120
Their world has interesting superstitions.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:05.180
I wonder how Chris and the others are doing...

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:10.720
Here it comes!

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:11.850
It’s started!

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.400
I see another one!

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.700
I'm starting the recording!

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:19.850
Huh?

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.740
Isn’t there something strange about that star?

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:26.460
It seems to be coming towards us!

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:48.990
There's someone lying on the ground!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.220
She's breathing.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:12.820
Cream's house is the closest. We have to give her medical care quickly!

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:14.860
I’ll tell my mama!

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:19.840
Did this child come from outer space?

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:51.370
You're finally awake.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:55.470
Eggman?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:07:00.470
You were badly hurt and lying on the beach.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.120
This is tough.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:16.800
I don’t know what happened, but I can't have you dying in my neighborhood.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:21.930
You should be thankful that I'm such a saint that I'm willing to save the life of my enemy.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.940
This is a fine example of the Japanese term "giving salt to an enemy."

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.900
I don't really understand what that means.

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:34.400
Why were you so beaten up?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.480
I can't stay here and do nothing!

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:40.470
Sorry, but I really have to go.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:43.810
Sonic!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.080
Thanks, Eggman!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.440
He’s just as rude as ever!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:53.720
He should show his appreciation by treating us to a meal!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.640
That's right!

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:58.540
That's right! Buy us a cake, Sonic!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.770
What should I do...

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.820
I want steak and spaghetti!

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.930
And a drink!

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:36.780
Cosmo! Run!

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.890
She regained consciousness.

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:51.420
You should still rest.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:56.610
Don't push yourself. You fell out of the sky, after all.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:00.920
Are you from another planet?

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.940
Just as I thought.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:06.270
What's your name?

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.810
I'm...

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.120
I can't.

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:13.700
Your name is "Icant?"

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.470
That’s not it. I can’t talk to you.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:22.260
There's someone named Sonic on this planet.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:26.450
I came because there's something important that I have to tell him.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:30.440
You can't tell your name to someone other than Sonic?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.950
I'm sorry.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:36.300
Hey, what's your relationship with Sonic?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.150
Huh?

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:42.690
Make sure you remember that I'm Sonic’s honey!

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:44.980
Is that clear?

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.560
Amy, please calm down!

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:52.980
We’re Sonic’s friends.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.580
Friends?

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:58.960
I’m Miles Prower. Everyone calls me Tails.

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.540
I’m Cream. Pleased to meet you.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:05.470
I’m Amy Rose! Sonic’s future bride!

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:10.230
Sonic is out right now. I don't know when he's coming back.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:14.440
Why don't you talk to us instead?

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.270
I'm sorry.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:17.780
You really can't?

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:28.730
What is it?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.140
What is that?

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.030
You shouldn’t get up yet!

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.070
Metarex...

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:18.210
An iron monster?

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:23.500
Preserve Planet Egg. Begin retrieval.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:35.990
What is that? It's destroying the forest!

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:43.330
Hey, cut it out!

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:01.170
Knuckles!

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:04.660
Tails! What is that thing?

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.350
I don’t have the slightest idea.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:15.900
Tails, back me up! I’m going to stop that thing!

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.960
I'm going into battle. Are you okay with that?

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:20.650
Yes.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.080
This is terrible! The forest!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:39.320
What's with that robot?

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:47.000
And not only is that girl riding the X-Tornado, she knows the identity of that robot.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.200
Who is she?

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.680
Our attacks have no effect!

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:03.900
Normal attacks won’t work against Metarex.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:07.740
So you know what it is. What is it?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:13.250
It's a death machine that steals the lives of planets.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:24.260
Sonic!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.830
Sonic!

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:33.110
Are you all right?

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.110
Yes.

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:37.800
So that’s Sonic.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:51.050
You're out of control.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:12.660
Hmm...

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:24.630
Wait, if I switch these values...

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:28.550
I did it!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.550
I didn't realize it was something this simple.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:41.190
My theories and this device will take me to Sonic’s world.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:45.690
Although it took me 6 years, I finally completed it.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.630
Sonic...

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.760
Sonic!

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:18.930
I got it!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.120
My attacks don't work!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:39.120
It's surprisingly tough.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.120
What is it?

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.130
Nothing. Let's go!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:50.050
He’s the hero that controls the Chaos Emeralds.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:55.640
I wonder what’s wrong? Sonic is moving slower than usual.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:08.730
Its armor is too hard! If we keep fighting like this, we can't win!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:12.320
Sonic, use the Chaos Emeralds!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:16.030
I’ll act as a decoy, so you defeat it while it’s distracted!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:20.370
Sorry! The Chaos Emeralds have blown away into the far reaches of space.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.170
Say what?

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:28.210
I was in a fix, so I hid them in outer space.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.090
Actually, I let them escape.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:35.930
In other words, there are no Chaos Emeralds on this planet?

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.300
Nothing!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.930
How could you do that!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.390
Knuckles, this isn't the time for this.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.810
Sonic!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.480
Knuckles!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.530
Watch out!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:04.290
This is for tranquility and order in the galaxy!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.970
No!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.800
What is that?

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.050
Planet Egg...

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.100
Planet Egg?

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.770
It's the crystallization of this planet's life force.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:22.280
If a planet loses its Planet Egg, it loses its life energy and dies.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.840
Retrieval complete. Withdraw!

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:38.760
Stop!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.060
Sonic!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.730
Sonic! Knuckles!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.650
I won't let you escape!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:12.170
It's no good! This aircraft can't fly into outer space!

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:15.090
Are you all right?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.510
Yes, somewhat...

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:21.720
Good. Let’s get back to everyone.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.220
Can you please open this?

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.810
This opened when we boarded.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:32.150
But if I open it right now, strong winds will come blowing in.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.560
Please.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:36.280
If you insist.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:39.450
Will this do?

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:58.210
You’re badly wounded. When did that happen?

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.510
Sonic, are you all right?

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.470
Don’t worry! It’s no big deal.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:22.110
Hello. My name is Cosmo.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.240
You’re Sonic, aren’t you?

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:25.530
Yes.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:30.910
The only hero in the galaxy that controls the miraculous gems known as the Chaos Emeralds.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:35.250
Please save this universe from a tremendous crisis!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.540
What?

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:43.800
Huh?

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.940
Sonic! Knuckles!

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:59.110
The Master Emerald is glowing!

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.530
What?

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:07.950
Please forgive me for leaving without saying a word.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:13.250
This teleportation experiment is very dangerous.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:18.630
I didn't say anything because I know you will try to stop me.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.460
But I promise that I'll return.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:30.810
So don't worry about me. I love you, Father, Mother, Grandpa, Danny, Francis... and Helen.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.180
– Christopher Thorndyke

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.510
Sonic...

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:16.980
Chris?

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:20.310
I did it! I succeeded!

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:23.280
I made it to Sonic's world!

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:24.820
Sonic!

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:53.400
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:53.400
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:53.400
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.300
<i>Original Concept Created by</i>

